<v Speaker 2>This is where the mathematical symmetry becomes visible.

67
00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:22.350
<v Speaker 2>The text explains that those 7 messengers are the inner spiritual aspect of the seven visible heavens.

68
00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:28.870
<v Speaker 2>and the structure cascades downward from there into what we can observe as the 12s and 30s.

69
00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.830
<v Speaker 1>The 12s and 30s.

70
00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:30.990
<v Speaker 1>Walk us through that mapping.

71
00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:36.750
<v Speaker 2>So beneath the speaker prophets are the imams who act as spiritual sons for their specific eras.

72
00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:42.590
<v Speaker 2>And each of those spiritual sons has 12 highly ranked intellectual guides known as chieftains.

73
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:47.950
<v Speaker 1>Oh, so those 12 chieftains perfectly mirror the 12 constellations of the zodiac in the sky above.

74
00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:48.910
<v Speaker 2>You've got it.

75
00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:56.510
<v Speaker 2>The celestial mechanics directly reflect the spiritual hierarchy, and it continues to ground itself closer to human life.

76
00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.230
