<v Speaker 1>And the 30s, where do they come in?

79
00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:10.750
<v Speaker 2>Beneath the proofs, operating locally on the ground, are 30 summoners.

80
00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.710
