86
00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:47.470
<v Speaker 1>I don't buy that yet calling the inner the true religion demotes the law to a costume.

87
00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:53.830
<v Speaker 1>Like even with all this brilliant mathematical symmetry, it makes it sound like the physical practices, the

88
00:05:54.030 --> 00:06:03.430
<v Speaker 1>ruling daily rituals, the mundane grind of the revealed law are just a superficial shell that you eventually discard once you figure out the celestial math underneath.

89
00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.430
