<v Speaker 2>Before we do, let me ground this by repeating the core thesis verbatim.

95
00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.790
<v Speaker 2>The inner is the true religion.

96
00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:29.710
<v Speaker 2>The outer is its revealed paths and symbols, body and spirit, each subsisting only through the other.

